{"id":"bushwick-collective","name":"The Bushwick Collective","nameRu":"The Bushwick Collective","nameDe":"The Bushwick Collective","cat":"walk","sub":"street-art walk","subRu":"прогулка по стрит-арту","subDe":"Street-Art-Spaziergang","hood":"Bushwick","boro":"Brooklyn","addr":"Troutman St at St Nicholas Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11237","lat":40.70594,"lng":-73.9233,"geo":"block","web":"https://www.thebushwickcollective.com/","tickets":"","reserve":"","menu":"","ig":"https://www.instagram.com/thebushwickcollective/","hours":"anytime, best in daylight","closed":[],"price":"free","dur":60,"best":"afternoon","lead":"walk-in","why":"Twenty blocks of warehouse walls given over to muralists from all over the world, repainted constantly. The best free outdoor gallery in the city.","whyRu":"Двадцать кварталов складских стен, отданных муралистам со всего мира и перекрашиваемых постоянно. Лучшая бесплатная галерея под открытым небом в городе.","whyDe":"Zwanzig Blocks Lagerhauswände, überlassen Muralisten aus aller Welt und ständig neu bemalt. Die beste kostenlose Freiluftgalerie der Stadt.","tips":["Start at the Jefferson St L stop and wander — there is no route","Daylight only; it is an industrial area after dark"],"tags":["free","outdoor","photo","hidden-gem"],"mike":false,"conf":"high","verified":"hand-written Sep 2026","lane":"brooklyn","hoursRu":"в любое время, лучше при дневном свете","hoursDe":"jederzeit, am besten bei Tageslicht","priceRu":"бесплатно","priceDe":"kostenlos","leadRu":"без записи","leadDe":"ohne Reservierung","tipsRu":["Начните от станции Jefferson St линии L и просто бродите — маршрута здесь нет","Только при дневном свете; после темноты это промзона"],"tipsDe":["An der L-Station Jefferson St starten und einfach treiben lassen — eine Route gibt es nicht","Nur bei Tageslicht; nach Einbruch der Dunkelheit ist es ein Industriegebiet"]},
{"id":"the-high-line","name":"The High Line","cat":"walk","sub":"elevated park walk","hood":"Meatpacking / Chelsea","boro":"Manhattan","addr":"Gansevoort St entrance, 820 Washington St, New York, NY 10014 (runs to W 34th St)","lat":40.73999,"lng":-74.00806,"geo":"exact","web":"https://www.thehighline.org/","tickets":"","reserve":"","menu":"","ig":"https://www.instagram.com/highlinenyc/","hours":"Daily 7am–10pm (Apr 1–Nov 30)","closed":[],"price":"free","dur":90,"best":"morning","lead":"walk-in","why":"A 1.45-mile garden on an old freight railway with planting by Piet Oudolf, art, and glimpses into Chelsea galleries and Zaha Hadid's building — the most stylish free walk in the city.","tips":["Start at Gansevoort St (next to the Whitney) and walk north to end at Hudson Yards/Vessel/Edge — that is the natural sequence for a half-day","Go before 10am on a weekday; weekend afternoons are a slow shuffle","Stop at the 10th Ave Square 'amphitheater' window over traffic and the 23rd St lawn","Pair: Chelsea Market (exit at 16th St), Whitney Museum at the start, Little Island 5 minutes west of the Gansevoort entrance"],"tags":["iconic","first-timer","free","outdoor","photo","walk-in","classic-nyc"],"mike":false,"conf":"high","verified":"extract: fall hours + entrance coords Sep 2026","nameRu":"Хай-Лайн","lane":"icons","nameDe":"High Line","subRu":"прогулка по парку на эстакаде","subDe":"Parkspaziergang auf der Hochtrasse","whyRu":"Сад длиной 1,45 мили на старой грузовой железной дороге: посадки Пита Удольфа, искусство и виды в окна галерей Челси и дома Захи Хадид — самая стильная бесплатная прогулка в городе.","whyDe":"Ein 1,45 Meilen langer Garten auf einer alten Güterbahntrasse, bepflanzt von Piet Oudolf, dazu Kunst und Blicke in die Chelsea-Galerien und in Zaha Hadids Haus — der stilvollste kostenlose Spaziergang der Stadt.","hoursRu":"Ежедневно 7:00–22:00 (1 апреля – 30 ноября)","hoursDe":"Täglich 7–22 Uhr (1. April – 30. November)","priceRu":"бесплатно","priceDe":"kostenlos","leadRu":"без записи","leadDe":"ohne Reservierung","tipsRu":["Начните на Gansevoort St (рядом с Уитни) и идите на север, чтобы закончить у Hudson Yards / Vessel / Edge — это естественный порядок для полудня","Идите в будний день до 10:00; в выходные после обеда здесь двигаются шаг за шагом","Задержитесь у «амфитеатра» на 10th Ave Square с окном над потоком машин и у лужайки на 23rd St","Совместить: Chelsea Market (выход на 16th St), Музей Уитни в начале, Little Island в пяти минутах к западу от входа на Gansevoort"],"tipsDe":["An der Gansevoort St (neben dem Whitney) starten und nach Norden laufen, bis Hudson Yards/Vessel/Edge — das ist die natürliche Reihenfolge für einen halben Tag","An einem Wochentag vor 10 Uhr hingehen; am Wochenende nachmittags schiebt man sich im Schritttempo","Haltet am „Amphitheater“ des 10th Ave Square mit dem Fenster über dem Verkehr und an der Rasenfläche an der 23rd St","Kombinieren: Chelsea Market (Ausgang 16th St), das Whitney Museum am Anfang, Little Island fünf Minuten westlich vom Eingang Gansevoort"]}
